  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "山豬湖看火金蛄"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿青講beh去華山ê山豬湖看火金蛄，順suà hip幾張仔相做記念，tsiūnn車差不多五分鐘就駛到íng過tsiânn鬧熱ê咖啡小街，tsit-tsūn顛倒恬tsiuh-tsiuh無幾隻貓仔leh出入，hōo人想lóng無。現此時，橫tī面頭前ê三叉路口無啥mih路標，三个人suah臆無佗一條tsiah是tio̍h--ê，規氣落車行倚去路邊ê導覽圖hia，提手電仔按頭tsîn到尾，干干仔摸無hit个所在，邊--a koh無人thang問，就凊彩選一條khah崎ê路來pua̍h看māi--leh。過to無一分鐘，拄好碰著一對翁仔某kā阮報路，真正翻頭koh駛差不多五分鐘，就看著倚山ê路邊pha tsiânn濟車，有大人kah囡仔leh講話ê聲tsiânn tân，爍來爍去ê手電仔tuì路口一直湠到山頭，lang-lang ê人影mā tuè幌前幌後ê火光leh爍無歇——tsia決定是山豬湖，無m̄-tio̍h。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">塗跤ê路面拍紅毛塗，tuè山勢leh se̍h來se̍h去不止仔崎，雙爿lóng種茶kah檳榔--ê占khah大面，tī菁仔欉長lòng-sòng ê烏影下跤，tsiok濟勻勻仔leh飛kuân飛低ê火金蛄光--一-下、爍--一-下，規山坪鬧熱滾滾。Peh到一搭tńg彎lap低ê林跤，kám是khah暗ê緣故，濟kah親像暝--時leh nih目睭ê天星，就是爍kah hiah-nī仔hiánn目，khah-ke mā圍tsiânn濟歡喜kah比讚、huah suí ê人，in lóng提手機仔、相機，koh有tshāi三跤架leh hip相--ê，m̄-koh iáu有幾tshok仔人tshi-bú-tshi-tshū leh講取景、快門、『曝光』ê撇步。有tshuân三跤架ê阿青講，tī暗bîn-bong ê所在hip火金蛄，伊講上無ài『曝光』一分鐘tsiah ē suí。Thìng候伊hip煞，翻倒tńg去相機揣檔案，內底kan-na一張ē看--得，看tsit款pān勢，若無--兩-步-七-仔，正經舞無路來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh peh--起-去、khah kuân ê山路，看ē著山跤規tshok光iānn-iānn ê人家厝、sio連suà ê路燈，白、黃、青、紅ê夜景bē輸ē放劍光ê真珠、寶石，suí kah無想beh徙跤，m̄-koh火金蛄就khah少--ah。阿青講siunn光ê所在對火金蛄來講是「光害」，烏烏暗暗tsiah是in kah意--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落山ê時tsūn，有兩三个hònn玄ê囡仔khû踮路中ng，kā火金蛄phâng tī手心thènn起thènn落，講beh順suà紮--tńg-去，iáu有袋入去白衫ê lak袋仔爍--一-下爍--一-下，bē輸tī胸前牽一pha青色ê ne-hóng án-ne。好得in ê家長lóng有出來擋，順suà教示一寡自然生態保護ê基本原則hōo in知，連阮mā聽kah耳仔khap-khap-khap，無想beh tńg--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/5vrQ47\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/5vrQ47</a>）</p><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQphGeoZ1lgv9Vwb7K9JOP1CoOYcZ7A_K5ckz2AbIh42QvqnES5A_5FERvp8DaKZlXTvzee54gyPQaRY5OoUpSC0Umdxg1swEQphlbqv_AAuzIRECWhNfuYwJEPNP7s8qHhyQ0oM8BXkS-27oXUQuPP-45hREF1m3NvETj80e8eZRXtjLnnnYJdWPI2WpF/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_8.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQphGeoZ1lgv9Vwb7K9JOP1CoOYcZ7A_K5ckz2AbIh42QvqnES5A_5FERvp8DaKZlXTvzee54gyPQaRY5OoUpSC0Umdxg1swEQphlbqv_AAuzIRECWhNfuYwJEPNP7s8qHhyQ0oM8BXkS-27oXUQuPP-45hREF1m3NvETj80e8eZRXtjLnnnYJdWPI2WpF/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_8.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjl6LqdHYg6zll6mCYLeWBVCOE0KvrdUc-0D5hjDhUXxCUFvQCDtPK7TU7aS4JYC4sm9ABu5t5b64sXueh7-mHI0aji_J1rqUFNQdhO9Kg9QkjLlOvn33XCljExxmLGaV7dVPC2RVCFvYn7UtjO4eRljcfLEol-tavgTihqVQqMITdEk9DiUvmhFW5JdY2c/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_9.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjl6LqdHYg6zll6mCYLeWBVCOE0KvrdUc-0D5hjDhUXxCUFvQCDtPK7TU7aS4JYC4sm9ABu5t5b64sXueh7-mHI0aji_J1rqUFNQdhO9Kg9QkjLlOvn33XCljExxmLGaV7dVPC2RVCFvYn7UtjO4e